export anchor BackgroundColor:
    description:
        Sets the colour painted behind the component's content and padding, beneath any background image.

    identifier: backgroundColor

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `background-color` property.

    values:
        - `none`
        - `<color>`

    initial: none

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            backgroundColor: #f4f4f5
        \\\
        ```
